{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Day With Vanessa"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "At The Art Gallery"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking for Clarification and Emphasizing a Point"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You ask for clarification when it is not clear what the other person is referring to. You ask the other person to be more specific by giving you more information. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use a question at the beginning of a statement or question to ask for clarification like: <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Don't you think</span> ... ?</span><br/>Questions within sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: </span><br/><span class=\"strong\">Simple question:</span> What are you going to do after dinner?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Embedded question:</span> Do you know what you're going to do after dinner?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart below for an explanation on how to make embedded questions."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Direct Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Embedded Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you know ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you remember ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you tell me ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could you tell me ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Can you remind me who the artist you wanted to see is?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you remember where he's from?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Could you tell me again who that is?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Showing You Understand Someone's Feelings or Emotions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In conversation, it is natural to show that you understand someone's feelings and emotions. It helps to use different kinds of structures and expressions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the structures:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You <span class=\"strong\">ought to be/ must be</span> +adjective<br/>It <span class=\"strong\">ought to be</span>/must be + adjective<br/>You've /It's <span class=\"strong\">got to be</span> +adjective<br/>I'm sure that's/you're + adjective<br/>Aren't you +adjective?<br/>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can also use these expressions:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I get it.<br/>I know what you mean.<br/>I hear you."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You must feel really silly right now ..."}, {"type": "example", "content": " I know what you mean."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You must be desperate for a social life. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to pop in"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to go into a place (a building)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's pop in at the art gallery."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le16ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about art."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to read up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to read about someone or something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll read up online about him."},