ontrols", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le16ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le16ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Let's pop in at the art gallery. Can you remind me who the artist you wanted to see is?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Ai Wei Wei. Do you remember where he's from?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         China! Yes, I remember now. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     When we get there, I'll quiz you. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Before you do, I'll read up online about him.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le16ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "18500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Wow, this is really imaginative stuff! He must be brilliant! I love seeing art installations. After we walk through the show, I'll have to buy a souvenir.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     I know what you mean. If we come to the gallery again, we'll have to see the Douglas Coupland exhibit.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Could you tell me again who that is?", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le16ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "37500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Oh, Sal. You must feel really silly right now ... <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:          Well, unlike you, I don't read about artists in my spare time!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Do you remember when you were in Europe and you visited all those museums? You must be an art connoisseur by now!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le16ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "51500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Hardly! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     You should come to an art workshop with me sometime. It's really enlightening. There are so many artists out there! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         A workshop?! You must be desperate for a social life.", "id": 4, "image": "engenn7le16ob02re2img05.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le16ob02re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}